                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "The number of items per page"
              },
              {
                "name": "sort",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "The attribute to sort by. Prefix with \"-\" for descending order.\nSupported values: \"alphabetical-rx-name\", \"last-fill-date\", or field names like \"disp_status\", \"prescription_name\", \"dispensed_date\"\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "List medications for the current user. This endpoint uses the Unified Health Data (Oracle Health) backend\nand requires the `mhv_medications_cerner_pilot` feature flag to be enabled.\n\nSupports filtering, sorting, and pagination. Results can be filtered by prescription status and sorted\nby various attributes. Pending (PD) prescriptions are included based on the `mhv_medications_display_pending_meds`\nfeature flag.\n"
        },
        {
